        "cooked": "<p>It must be convenient for C&amp;A to be able to blame their mistakes on an entire fictional universe full of nameless, faceless comic-industry goons.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Of course, this might not have been a mistake, but an intentional “artistic” choice.  Still bugs me either way though.</p>",
